  "description": {
    "about": {
      "items": [
        {
          "items": [
            "Home Highlights:<br>– Gulf views<br>– Approximately 250 Steps to Beach<br>– Private resort style pool and spa (Pool can be heated for an additional $70 per day from October 1 - May 1)<br>- Complimentary beach setups include 2 chairs and 1 umbrella - Service provided Mar 1-Oct 31<br>– Outdoor oasis featuring an expansive outdoor kitchen, Wolf grill, and TV<br>– Rooftop deck<br>– Game room with pool table, foosball, and wet bar<br>- Elevator<br>- Peloton shown is based on availability and pricing<br>- 6 seater Golf Cart included <br>- Six Adult Bikes<br><br>Simple and beautifully curated, this Seagrove Social does beach life the natural way. The down-to-earth decor and comfortable living space feels inviting and warm. In the mornings, stop by the local farmers’ market and seafood shops. When the sun goes down, cook your fresh finds in the outdoor kitchen while the kids swim and play. We love how close this home is to the beaches but when you’ve had enough sun and sand, take a dip in your own private pool!<br><br>SLEEPING ARRANGEMENTS<br><br>FIRST FLOOR<br>– Guest Bedroom: King Bed, Private Bathroom with Shower Only<br>– Guest Bedroom: King Bed, Private Bathroom with Shower Only<br>– Bunk Room: Two Twin-over-Twin Bunk Beds, One Queen-over-Queen Bunk Bed, Private Bathroom with Shower Only<br><br>SECOND FLOOR<br>-Master Suite: King Bed, Private Bathroom with Shower and Tub<br><br>THIRD FLOOR<br><br>– Junior Master: King Bed, Private Bathroom with Shower and Tub<br>– Guest Bedroom: King Bed, Private Bathroom with Shower Only<br>– Guest Bedroom: King Bed, Private Bathroom with Shower Only<br>- Guest Bedroom: King Bed, Shared Bathroom with Shower Only<br>– Two twin-over-twin bunk beds, Shared bathroom with Shower Only<br><br>**During peak season, all of our properties are rented with a 7-night minimum from Saturday to Saturday.**",
            "Our prices include all fees. No hidden fees."
